    "B62B": {
      "code": "B62B",
      "level": 5,
      "parent": "B62",
      "ja": "　手動推進車両，例．ハンドカート，乳母車；そり｛特記．　以下のＩＰＣグループはＥＣＬＡ分類表では使用されない。これらのグループに包含される主題事項は，以下の各ＥＣＬＡグループに分類する:Ｂ６２Ｂ３／０６５はＢ６２Ｂ３／０６Ｂ４に包含。｝注．１．　このサブクラスにおいては　ハンドカートという用語は，ハンドカートに特徴のあるかぎり手動推進車輪付装置も含み，この用語はまたハンドカートに特徴のあるかぎり歩行制御動力駆動車両も含む。２．　ローラは，車輪と同等に解釈される。",
      "en": "HAND-PROPELLED VEHICLES, e.g. HAND CARTS OR PERAMBULATORS; SLEDGES (characterised by animal propulsion B62C; propulsion of sledges by driver or engine B62M)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this subclass, the term \"hand carts\" also embraces hand-propelled wheeled devices in so far as the features thereof are generic to hand carts. This term also embraces pedestrian-controlled power-driven vehicles in so far as the features thereof are generic to hand carts<br>Rollers are taken as being equivalent to wheels<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br>The following IPC groups are not in the CPC scheme. The subject matter for these IPC groups is classified in the following CPC groups: B62B3/065 covered by B62B3/0618<br>In this subclass non-limiting references (in the sense of paragraph 39 of the Guide to the IPC) may still be displayed in the scheme.",
      "count": 0,
      "ipcCode": "",
      "coreCode": "",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
